        {
          "id": "17e606db-ba16-4f75-8f85-ecf3c5f28bea",
          "memory": "User and Maya confirmed lunch at Rosa's on Oak Street at 12:30 on October 2, 2026, with a half order of garlic knots to start to save room. User will grab a table, do a chair safety test, and hope for patio seating. Maya will walk over while working from home and User will slip out from the office for an hour to an hour and a half.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "c05ecc61-ba95-4ab8-a080-9f845b310d84",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, Maya briefly confused Rosa's with Luigi's after googling pizza near Oak and opening Luigi's margherita menu with different prices. She realized Luigi's was not where they were going and said Rosa's garlic knots are the whole point.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2adaee0b-804e-44f8-ac68-dde16612b03b",
          "memory": "On the evening of October 1, 2026, Maya heated up soup for dinner and User had leftover pasta. They agreed it is now soup and pasta weather with chilly fall evenings, with Maya getting chilly with her window open and User grabbing a blanket.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "0d9015b2-1305-48e1-a70b-11b8bda6547f",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, Maya's laptop was being weird all afternoon and almost crashed with 20 tabs open. She closed them all and said it forgave her, with User joking that is why it hates her.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "0a15c584-2c30-4627-9a11-d3e17d7ba5fb",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, Maya said her basil was still alive to her shock and she was watering it at that moment. User said their own plants were a little droopy and needed watering that night, promising to do it after texting.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ee44ae38-8c29-4e59-a708-2ad39f386ca5",
          "memory": "As of October 1, 2026, Maya still had not sent User the name of the chaotic baking show with the mop cake. Maya promised to send it after the episode ends from her history, and User wanted it as background noise for folding laundry.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "80b0f468-bf90-4499-8687-8de77474934e",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, User was folding laundry while their female cat twice sat on the clean load and had to be evicted. User said clean laundry was currently chair decor again, and Maya said they both use the chair system.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "6bd1aac0-b301-4931-aef8-f1989634c5b2",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, Devon's cat was already judging her when she got home, screaming when she walked in, then ignoring her after being fed.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "0e87b15c-fda0-4af2-bf6e-a9fb60153924",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, User planned to heat up lemon pepper chicken from the freezer from last week before it gets freezer burn. Devon had leftover chicken nuggets for lunch and felt snacky. They joked the freezer dinner beats cereal, which Devon defended as elite.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "5a71e1be-54e7-4d60-b96d-9379b6156c94",
          "memory": "On October 1, 2026, User said work was not bad with just a lot of emails. Devon's day was quiet for once because her boss was out, with no last-minute chart hell that had haunted Devon for weeks.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "bd14f4b5-a777-4961-ada4-8548b94d2a6b",
          "memory": "As of October 1, 2026, traffic on 5th Street was still bad with cones everywhere by the bank. User said they cut through by Oak that day to avoid it, which Devon called a good call.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "84ec0595-e1ec-4d58-a971-303d89883ce0",
          "memory": "As of October 1, 2026, Devon's mom got her groceries sorted last weekend and is stocked now. Devon said her mom still brings up User and the potato salad, which User called elite, and her mom plans to make it again soon.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "31c8f078-864e-4a5f-8e31-78f6785564ab",
          "memory": "User is doing pottery again next Tuesday and invited Maya and her sister to come sometime in October, with Maya saying her sister is still saying someday. User joked the Tuesday instructor is waiting, Maya said her wavy bowl aspirations are low, and User said their own bowl now holds keys as functional art.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "18b1140b-cc1f-44b4-9685-5c8636b974f8",
          "memory": "User and Devon moved their dinner at Mario's on Pine Street on October 2, 2026 from 6 p.m. to 7 p.m. because Devon has to stay about 30 minutes late to cover something. They will text when leaving the office, aim for right at 7, use parking in back, and grab a table if first.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f682b5c3-6df2-4cf7-953f-775784bec5a2",
          "memory": "For the Mario's dinner, User is craving cheesy slices and Devon wants something heavier than Rosa's thin crust margherita from last time after Devon's team ordering from Mario's last week got her hooked. They agreed it beats sad 2 p.m. Domino's, and Devon said a Saturday team lunch idea was dropped after everyone complained.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
